# Secret group `master-key`: The key that decrypts `external_credentials`. Never loaded by transcribe or the gateway.
# Loaded by: semprec-api.service, semprec-agents.service.
#
# Ownership and mode are load-bearing: `root:root 0600`. systemd reads EnvironmentFile= as root
# before dropping privileges. provision.sh installs this template to
# /opt/semprec/shared/env/master-key.env only when that file does not exist, so an operator's values are
# never overwritten by a rerun, and it never prints a value. A key belongs to exactly one group
# (docs/adr/2026-10-03-per-service-secret-groups.md); this file is excluded from restic backups.

# CREDENTIALS_MASTER_KEY: base64-encoded 32-byte XSalsa20-Poly1305 key (see
# packages/credentials/src/index.ts's resolveMasterKeyFromEnv) that decrypts every row in
# `external_credentials`. Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
# Rotation would add CREDENTIALS_MASTER_KEY_V2 etc. alongside this one — out of scope here (no
# rotation automation), but the naming is already versioned so a future issue can add it without
# touching this one.
CREDENTIALS_MASTER_KEY=
